$ Ruessink breaking
$
$ Identical to src_break_rue apart from the one formulation line below, so the two
$ decks isolate this formulation. Added for path coverage: before this deck the
$ repository never selected it, so the bounds-checked CI build never reached it.
PROJECT 'SRC_BREAK_RUE' '001'
SET CARTESIAN
MODE STATIONARY ONEDIMENSIONAL
COORDINATES CARTESIAN

CGRID REGULAR 0.0 0.0 0.0 50000.0 0.0 250 0 &
      CIRCLE 36 0.04 1.0 34
INPGRID BOTTOM REGULAR 0.0 0.0 0.0 50 0 1000.0 1.0
READINP BOTTOM 1.0 'bottom.bot' 1 0 FREE

WIND 15.0 0.0
BOUND SHAPESPEC JONSWAP 3.3 PEAK DSPR DEGREES
BOUNDSPEC SIDE WEST CONSTANT PAR 0.5 5.0 0.0 20.0

GEN3 WESTH
QUADRUPLET 3
TRIAD FTIM
BREAKING RUESSINK
FRICTION JONSWAP CONSTANT 0.038

POINTS 'GAUGES' 0.0 0.0 20000.0 0.0 40000.0 0.0 &
         45000.0 0.0 48000.0 0.0 50000.0 0.0
TABLE 'GAUGES' HEADER 'src_break_rue.tbl' XP DEPTH HSIGN TM01 GENW DISW DISSU DISB
SPECOUT 'GAUGES' SPEC1D ABS 'src_break_rue.spc'
TEST 1 0 POINTS XY 45000.0 0.0 S1D 'src_break_rue_sources.spc'

COMPUTE
STOP
